      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300602/2023006020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "はい、あの\r\n入っていただいて早々に申し訳無いんですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006020031,
    "speaker": "雛菜＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300602/2023006020031"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "実は今日こちらで手配していたメイクスタッフが\r\nトラブルで遅れてまして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、そうなんですか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "今代わりの者を当たっているところなんですが\r\n少しお待ち頂くことになってしまうのと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "もしかすると準備が\r\n本番ギリギリになってしまうかと──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006020040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202300602/2023006020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですか、わかりました\r\n仕方ないですよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ雛菜、\r\nしばらく控室で待って──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006020050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……あの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300602/2023006020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006020060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、もしよかったら\r\n自分でメイクするのでもいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202300602/2023006020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "え…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2023006020070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ、でも\r\n待ってた方がよさそうなら──……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
